      "text": "椭 圆",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "originalText": "椭 圆",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c1_def",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 270,
      "text": "|PF₁|+|PF₂|=2a\ne = c/a ∈ (0,1)\nc² = a² − b²",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "originalText": "|PF₁|+|PF₂|=2a\ne = c/a ∈ (0,1)\nc² = a² − b²",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c1_eq",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 350,
      "text": "x²/a² + y²/b² = 1",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "originalText": "x²/a² + y²/b² = 1",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c1_note",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 380,
      "text": "e越大→越扁；e越小→越圆",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "originalText": "e越大→越扁；e越小→越圆",
      "autoResize": true
